# Colours for desk.obj.
#
# Every channel is a multiple of 0x11, because the panel is four bits per
# channel and a colour that is not shifts on the device and nowhere else.
#
# White top, red front. The red is the only saturated thing at that height in
# the room and it is what the eye lands on when the player walks in.

newmtl desk_top
Kd 0.933333 0.933333 0.933333   # #EEEEEE

newmtl desk_face
Kd 0.800000 0.266667 0.266667   # #CC4444

newmtl desk_side
Kd 0.733333 0.733333 0.733333   # #BBBBBB
